---
// Closing call to action for Operations Notes articles. Sits outside the article body on a navy band.
---

<section class="note-cta" aria-labelledby="note-cta-title">
  <div class="note-cta-inner">
    <h2 id="note-cta-title">Know something in your business could work better?</h2>
    <p>
      Standard Method Group helps businesses find operational problems and put practical improvements in place.
      That starts with a conversation about where work gets stuck.
    </p>
    <div class="note-cta-actions">
      <a href="/contact/" class="note-cta-primary">Book a 30-minute call</a>
      <a href="/services/" class="note-cta-secondary">Explore our services</a>
    </div>
    <p class="note-cta-more">
      Related: <a href="/services/#business-systems">business systems and process improvement</a>
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .note-cta {
    background: var(--color-navy);
    padding: var(--space-8) 0;
    margin-top: var(--space-12);
  }

  .note-cta-inner {
    max-width: calc(40rem + 2 * var(--space-3));
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 var(--space-3);
  }

  h2 {
    font-size: 1.75rem;
    letter-spacing: var(--tracking-heading);
    color: var(--color-white);
    margin: 0 0 var(--space-2);
  }

  p {
    font-size: 1.125rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--color-ink-on-dark);
    margin: 0;
  }

  .note-cta-actions {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: var(--space-2);
    margin: var(--space-3) 0;
  }

  a {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-weight: var(--font-weight-heading);
    font-size: 1rem;
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  a:focus-visible {
    outline: 3px solid var(--color-teal-light);
    outline-offset: 2px;
  }

  .note-cta-primary {
    background: var(--color-teal);
    color: var(--color-white);
    padding: 15px 28px;
  }

  .note-cta-primary:hover { background: var(--color-deep-teal); color: var(--color-white); }

  .note-cta-secondary {
    color: var(--color-white);
    padding: 13px 26px;
    border: 2px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);
  }

  .note-cta-secondary:hover { border-color: var(--color-white); color: var(--color-white); }

  .note-cta-more { font-size: 1rem; }

  .note-cta-more a {
    color: var(--color-teal-light);
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: 3px;
  }

  .note-cta-more a:hover { color: var(--color-white); }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .note-cta { padding: var(--space-5) 0; margin-top: var(--space-8); }
    h2 { font-size: 1.5rem; }
    .note-cta-actions { flex-direction: column; }
    .note-cta-primary, .note-cta-secondary { text-align: center; }
  }
</style>
